WEBVTT

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:03.252
Tonight at 11:00...

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:05.797
Doom!

00:00:26.869 --> 00:00:29.203
Boy, that thing's big.

00:00:29.288 --> 00:00:31.622
Fry, is my colossal eye
too big?

00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:34.250
No, it's what
makes you you.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.587
But it's so round,
so hideously round.

00:00:37.671 --> 00:00:39.088
Leela, listen.

00:00:39.173 --> 00:00:42.091
You're the most beautiful woman I've ever known.

00:00:42.176 --> 00:00:44.594
Oh. So you only care
about my looks?

00:00:44.678 --> 00:00:46.179
No, I... What?

00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:49.682
Finally, New New York
got a blast of class today

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:53.519
as Nikolai, playboy ruler
of the Robo-Hungarian Empire,

00:00:53.604 --> 00:00:56.898
arrived aboard his extravagant
caviar-powered yacht.

00:00:56.982 --> 00:00:59.025
I am just
a humble emperor

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:01.277
with a big,
big crown!

00:01:01.779 --> 00:01:04.238
Of course I'm not planning to steal that crown!

00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:05.656
What?
True.

00:01:05.741 --> 00:01:07.825
I've always dreamed
of being an emperor.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.244
You know, for Halloween,
and then forever.

00:01:10.329 --> 00:01:12.872
But heisting those jewels
would be difficult.

00:01:12.956 --> 00:01:14.457
You'd be stupid to try.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.833
I'll need accomplices.

00:01:15.918 --> 00:01:18.419
A sexy vamp to distract
and tie up the guard.

00:01:18.504 --> 00:01:19.670
Never!

00:01:20.339 --> 00:01:22.757
A claw man to slip past
the metal detector

00:01:22.841 --> 00:01:24.300
and cut the alarm wires.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:27.470
Sorry, I'm set for life after that last job.

00:01:31.308 --> 00:01:33.017
And finally, a chump,

00:01:33.101 --> 00:01:35.228
to be caught on video
and later arrested.

00:01:35.479 --> 00:01:37.355
As I told you on
Sucker-Punch Day,

00:01:37.439 --> 00:01:38.731
I'm through being a chump.

00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:42.568
Of course, it would all require
split-second robotic timing.

00:01:42.653 --> 00:01:46.113
That's where I come in.
You see, I own a watch.

00:01:48.951 --> 00:01:52.995
There. This time I'm sure
I've fixed the mind switcher.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:56.374
Good, I'm sick of cleaning up
those heaps of dead monkeys.

00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:58.626
But why would you want your mind in a new body?

00:01:58.836 --> 00:02:02.004
Well, as a man
enters his 18th decade,

00:02:02.089 --> 00:02:04.841
he thinks back on the mistakes he's made in life.

00:02:05.259 --> 00:02:06.676
Like the heaps
of dead monkeys?

00:02:06.927 --> 00:02:09.679
Science cannot move forward
without heaps!

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:13.891
No, what I regret is the
youth I wasted playing it safe.

00:02:14.226 --> 00:02:16.769
I wasted my
youth porking out.

00:02:16.979 --> 00:02:18.437
Yes, I remember.

00:02:19.815 --> 00:02:21.190
Would you please
take that down?

00:02:21.275 --> 00:02:22.525
It's making me hungry.

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:26.279
Funny, I could use a little
extra meat on my bones.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:27.864
Wait a second!

00:02:27.948 --> 00:02:31.868
If we switched bodies, I
could live life to the extreme,

00:02:31.952 --> 00:02:34.453
and you could indulge
your demonic food lust.

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:38.833
We're just the people this mind
switcher was made for by us!

00:02:41.545 --> 00:02:43.671
Wait, can I still
change my mind?

00:02:43.755 --> 00:02:44.964
Let's find out.

00:02:51.763 --> 00:02:54.390
It didn't work, you
doddering old...

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.893
Ah! Cartilage!

00:02:56.977 --> 00:03:00.021
Dude, I bid you
a fond cowabunga.

00:03:00.105 --> 00:03:02.690
I'm off to laugh
at the Reaper.

00:03:08.363 --> 00:03:10.698
Look out, world,
here I...

00:03:15.245 --> 00:03:18.414
I'm sorry, Amy, but your
body's not up to the task.

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:22.418
Also, I don't care for these
boobs flapping every which way.

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:24.045
Now, quit your
bologna-gargling

00:03:24.129 --> 00:03:26.714
and let's switch back
into our original bodies.

00:03:27.215 --> 00:03:30.885
Body-switching, eh?
Mayhap the heist is back on.

00:03:30.969 --> 00:03:33.679
Who needs accomplices, if I
can just use their bodies?

00:03:39.186 --> 00:03:41.479
Professor,
what's not happening?

00:03:41.647 --> 00:03:43.397
Bad news, me.

00:03:43.482 --> 00:03:46.984
I failed to take into account
the cerebral immune response.

00:03:47.069 --> 00:03:48.235
You idiot!

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:50.988
Once two bodies
have switched minds,

00:03:51.073 --> 00:03:53.199
they can never
switch back.

00:03:55.118 --> 00:03:56.869
However,
perhaps they can.

00:03:57.037 --> 00:03:59.830
Maybe we can swap back
using a third body

00:03:59.915 --> 00:04:01.832
for temporary storage space.

00:04:02.084 --> 00:04:04.293
I'm 60% storage space.

00:04:05.379 --> 00:04:07.380
You are?
I... Mmm?

00:04:10.384 --> 00:04:12.051
Well, I'm off to
the royal yacht

00:04:12.135 --> 00:04:13.719
for a quick
seduce-and-snatch.

00:04:13.845 --> 00:04:15.805
See you!
Now, then, Amy

00:04:15.889 --> 00:04:18.432
we'll simply switch bodies,
and then we'll...

00:04:18.517 --> 00:04:19.517
We'll...

00:04:19.601 --> 00:04:21.769
No, I'd be back
in my body,

00:04:21.853 --> 00:04:23.771
but then you and Bender
would be switched.

00:04:23.855 --> 00:04:28.150
And the Amy and Bender bodies can't
trade minds again, since they just did.

00:04:28.402 --> 00:04:29.652
Oh, no!

00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:31.278
Is it possible to
get everyone back

00:04:31.363 --> 00:04:33.489
to normal using
four or more bodies?

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:34.699
I'm not sure.

00:04:34.783 --> 00:04:36.742
I'm afraid we need to use

00:04:37.369 --> 00:04:38.411
math.

00:04:45.377 --> 00:04:46.919
Stupid air-needing lungs.

00:04:48.463 --> 00:04:50.506
The crown jewels.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:53.467
Now I just have to locate
the guard and seduce him in...

00:04:54.094 --> 00:04:55.219
Four seconds?

00:04:55.345 --> 00:04:56.470
Who goes there?

00:04:56.555 --> 00:04:58.472
Three, two, one.

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:00.683
Hello, big boy.

00:05:03.186 --> 00:05:05.021
Silence!
I am Basil,

00:05:05.105 --> 00:05:07.481
the Emperor's cousin
and chief of his royal guard.

00:05:07.566 --> 00:05:09.442
And I shall not
be seduced by a...

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:11.694
I said...

00:05:19.494 --> 00:05:21.120
Professor?
What's the matter?

00:05:21.455 --> 00:05:24.582
I'm Amy. The Professor and I switched bodies.

00:05:24.708 --> 00:05:25.708
Oh, lord.

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:28.544
All I wanted was to
gorge myself a little,

00:05:28.628 --> 00:05:31.213
but I can't digest anything
with these false teeth

00:05:31.298 --> 00:05:33.090
and this hit-or-miss colon.

00:05:33.175 --> 00:05:35.593
At least you get a senior discount at the movies.

00:05:35.677 --> 00:05:39.889
I hate paying $14 to see
Nicolas Cage solve things.

00:05:39.973 --> 00:05:43.100
If you want to save $2,
we could switch bodies.

00:05:43.518 --> 00:05:46.270
Hmm. We can always
switch back, right?

00:05:52.152 --> 00:05:53.152
Hey, Leela.

00:05:53.236 --> 00:05:55.279
Mmm.
What smells saturated?

00:05:55.363 --> 00:05:58.991
Deep-fried ice cream sandwich wrapped
in frosting and lightly baconed.

00:05:59.201 --> 00:06:01.994
Whoa. That sounds like
something Amy would say and eat.

00:06:02.287 --> 00:06:05.790
I am Amy. Leela and I used the
Professor's mind-switching machine.

00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:08.375
So Leela's
in your body?

00:06:09.002 --> 00:06:10.044
Not exactly.

00:06:11.421 --> 00:06:14.215
Aha! You do only
like me for my body!

00:06:14.633 --> 00:06:16.967
That is entirely
not true, sir!

00:06:19.721 --> 00:06:23.474
Now to go switch bodies with
Zoidberg, sneak past the metal detector

00:06:23.558 --> 00:06:25.893
and clip the alarm wires,
all in less than...

00:06:26.478 --> 00:06:28.896
Ten minutes ago? Oh!

00:06:35.487 --> 00:06:38.447
Uh, could you come back
when my chump gets here?

00:06:42.661 --> 00:06:46.163
Now, then, what is a filthy human
doing aboard my royal yacht?

00:06:46.248 --> 00:06:49.542
With all due respect, Your
Majesty, I'm a robot like you.

00:06:49.626 --> 00:06:51.752
I just switched bodies
with some bimbo.

00:06:51.837 --> 00:06:54.421
Go ahead, ask me something
only a robot would know.

00:06:54.506 --> 00:06:57.049
A reverse Turing Test, eh?
Very good.

00:06:57.217 --> 00:06:58.634
What is the square root
of nine?

00:06:58.718 --> 00:07:01.220
Uh, hold on, let me
just get out a pencil.

00:07:01.847 --> 00:07:06.058
Okay, look, I'm not that kind of
robot. I'm more this kind of robot.

00:07:08.145 --> 00:07:11.063
He steps forwards
but moves backwards.

00:07:11.148 --> 00:07:13.399
By the gods!
He is a machine!

00:07:15.152 --> 00:07:17.903
No, that won't
restore everyone, either.

00:07:17.988 --> 00:07:21.574
Besides, I don't want
my decrepit old body back!

00:07:21.658 --> 00:07:26.245
I'm running away with this invincible
robot body and joining something.

00:07:30.792 --> 00:07:34.753
Look, I paid for 15 robot
clowns per cubic meter of car,

00:07:34.838 --> 00:07:38.799
and you're barely giving me 12.
Now, crumple up and get in...

00:07:38.884 --> 00:07:40.342
And fasten your seatbelts.

00:07:40.427 --> 00:07:42.052
Come on!

00:07:43.096 --> 00:07:44.263
Good day.

00:07:44.347 --> 00:07:47.683
I am Nonchalanto,
the robot daredevil.

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:52.730
And my dream is to risk my life
in strange and original ways.

00:07:52.856 --> 00:07:55.357
Hmm. You don't look
so foolhardy to me.

00:08:07.579 --> 00:08:10.080
That's the dumbest thing
anybody's ever done.

00:08:10.457 --> 00:08:11.707
You're hired!

00:08:16.129 --> 00:08:17.922
So you're a common
bending robot,

00:08:18.006 --> 00:08:19.673
with a human
peasant roommate?

00:08:19.758 --> 00:08:22.384
Oh, crap,
that is what I am!

00:08:22.469 --> 00:08:24.428
No, Bender, I envy you.

00:08:24.512 --> 00:08:26.805
I'm so bored with all these pretentious trappings.

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:29.558
The jewels, the parties,
the beautiful robo-women.

00:08:29.643 --> 00:08:30.809
Hello.

00:08:33.146 --> 00:08:35.689
My fiancйe,
Princess Flavia.

00:08:35.941 --> 00:08:39.693
Dearest, meet Bender. He's a robot in
the body of a Chinese Martian physicist.

00:08:39.945 --> 00:08:41.820
How tedious.

00:08:41.988 --> 00:08:45.366
Oh, to escape this
gilded cage for a day.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:48.410
You know,
we could trade bodies.

00:08:48.495 --> 00:08:50.537
I could take over
the humdrum royal stuff,

00:08:50.622 --> 00:08:52.331
and you could be
a regular Joe for a day.

00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:55.459
Or more. Much more.

00:08:55.543 --> 00:08:59.546
In that horrid non-robot body
? Sir, I have my standards.

00:08:59.756 --> 00:09:03.801
Ah, but what if I could put you
in my fabulous bending-robot body?

00:09:04.094 --> 00:09:07.680
Me, posing
as a lowly bending unit?

00:09:07.931 --> 00:09:09.098
How wicked!

00:09:09.557 --> 00:09:12.851
But wait, I'm supposed to give
a speech at the U. N. tomorrow.

00:09:12.936 --> 00:09:14.270
Can I trust you to do it?

00:09:14.396 --> 00:09:15.729
You can trust anything.

00:09:20.527 --> 00:09:22.027
So now Leela's
all crotchety

00:09:22.112 --> 00:09:25.072
because she thinks I'm not attracted
to her in the Professor's body.

00:09:25.282 --> 00:09:27.199
You aren't, are you?
Of course not!

00:09:27.284 --> 00:09:30.411
But I was willing to lie about
it. What more can a man do?

00:09:30.495 --> 00:09:32.830
A man can give her a toke
of her own medicine.

00:09:33.081 --> 00:09:35.958
Yes! I could put my mind
into a hideous body

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:38.252
and show Leela she's
not attracted to me.

00:09:38.628 --> 00:09:42.548
But it would have to be a
really, really disgusting body.

00:09:42.882 --> 00:09:46.719
Friends! Friends! I've
got barnacles on my tuchus.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.388
The long search is over.

00:09:50.015 --> 00:09:53.100
Wait here and earn interest
while I find my robot body.

00:09:56.604 --> 00:09:57.604
Professor?

00:09:57.689 --> 00:09:58.981
Leela. Amy?

00:09:59.065 --> 00:10:00.816
Bender.
Have you seen my body?

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.067
I think
the Professor's in it.

00:10:02.402 --> 00:10:04.778
Yeah, he said something
about running away.

00:10:05.071 --> 00:10:06.113
Then he ran away.

00:10:06.239 --> 00:10:07.323
What? Whither?

00:10:19.252 --> 00:10:20.294
What am I gonna do?

00:10:20.378 --> 00:10:22.838
I got an emperor all patsied up to switch bodies,

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:24.173
but only with
another robot!

00:10:24.507 --> 00:10:25.883
Washbucket full.

00:10:26.259 --> 00:10:27.718
Scruffy's work here
is done.

00:10:39.105 --> 00:10:41.648
Now to find Emperor
Von Richendoof.

00:10:41.733 --> 00:10:43.275
Now to find Scruffy.

00:10:45.445 --> 00:10:47.988
Switch bodies?
I don't see why not.

00:10:48.782 --> 00:10:50.449
I also don't see why.

00:10:52.994 --> 00:10:54.578
In your face, Leela.

00:10:54.913 --> 00:10:58.874
If you're a bender, why is
your body full of fetid water?

00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:00.918
If you're an emperor,
why don't you shut up?

00:11:01.294 --> 00:11:02.378
Move it, Fry!

00:11:05.131 --> 00:11:06.882
Well, so long.
Wait!

00:11:06.966 --> 00:11:08.550
Point me to my
normal human roommate!

00:11:08.635 --> 00:11:10.177
That's him there.
Maybe.

00:11:10.345 --> 00:11:11.595
Got to go!

00:11:12.806 --> 00:11:14.056
Robot?

00:11:14.182 --> 00:11:16.642
Yes, 'tis I, Bender.

00:11:16.726 --> 00:11:18.936
Do you not recognize
your own best friend?

00:11:19.145 --> 00:11:21.980
Aha! The guy in this body
has a friend!

00:11:22.357 --> 00:11:25.984
Bender, old pal!
It's me, the Fry!

00:11:28.321 --> 00:11:31.824
But then Nicolas Cage discovered
the real treasure was his family.

00:11:32.325 --> 00:11:33.659
Yes, I'll hold.

00:11:34.661 --> 00:11:36.912
Hey, Leela, look!
I'm in Zoidberg!

00:11:37.956 --> 00:11:38.956
Fry?

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.207
You're not so shallow

00:11:40.291 --> 00:11:43.168
that you find me repulsive
because of my body, are you?

00:11:46.172 --> 00:11:47.506
Not at all.

00:11:51.511 --> 00:11:53.095
Amy? Stop it!

00:11:53.179 --> 00:11:56.348
Fry, help! She's turning me into a parade float.

00:11:56.641 --> 00:11:58.100
Ew! Look at her!

00:11:59.936 --> 00:12:03.313
Oh. So you're so shallow
that my body disgusts you

00:12:03.398 --> 00:12:05.149
if it puts on
a little extra weight?

00:12:05.233 --> 00:12:07.067
That wasn't
a little extra weight.

00:12:07.152 --> 00:12:09.945
Admit it! You don't care
about the inner me at all!

00:12:10.029 --> 00:12:11.321
No, you admit it!

00:12:11.406 --> 00:12:13.031
You'd be ashamed
to be seen in public

00:12:13.116 --> 00:12:14.700
with someone as
hideous as me!

00:12:14.784 --> 00:12:16.577
Would not!
Oh, yeah?

00:12:16.661 --> 00:12:20.289
Then I challenge you to a
romantic dinner at Elzar's tonight.

00:12:20.373 --> 00:12:21.790
It's on.

00:12:27.505 --> 00:12:29.131
Sweet orca of Majorca!

00:12:29.215 --> 00:12:31.383
You make Fat Albert look
like Normal Albert!

00:12:31.634 --> 00:12:32.968
I don't know what to do.

00:12:33.052 --> 00:12:34.803
Do you think I
should eat more butter?

00:12:34.888 --> 00:12:36.847
I am putting a stop
to this right now!

00:12:36.931 --> 00:12:38.807
Come on.
We're switching bodies.

00:12:38.892 --> 00:12:42.186
Hermes, no!
I'll ruin your body, too!

00:12:43.146 --> 00:12:45.814
Three decades of the munchies
beat you to it.

00:13:03.791 --> 00:13:05.834
You make
quite a show, young man.

00:13:05.919 --> 00:13:08.587
You remind me of myself
as a young cannon.

00:13:08.671 --> 00:13:11.256
Big Bertha is
the circus's grande dame.

00:13:11.341 --> 00:13:13.342
She shoots robots
through the air.

00:13:14.928 --> 00:13:17.221
Excuse me.
Too much goulash.

00:13:17.305 --> 00:13:19.932
I've always wanted
to be shot out of something.

00:13:20.016 --> 00:13:22.351
How about a quick
blast after lunch?

00:13:22.519 --> 00:13:26.730
Alas, a fine big one like you
would shatter my barrel.

00:13:26.814 --> 00:13:30.192
But, ah, to amaze
the crowd once more.

00:13:30.568 --> 00:13:33.362
I understand
the problems of age,

00:13:33.446 --> 00:13:35.739
but suppose I could
put you in a new body?

00:13:35.823 --> 00:13:39.701
Never! My body may be old,
but it is mine,

00:13:39.786 --> 00:13:43.622
and every crack a memory of
heavy things shot a long way.

00:13:43.706 --> 00:13:45.207
Good day!

00:13:52.423 --> 00:13:56.552
I have everything I ever
wanted. Money, wealth, riches.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.512
Yet something's missing.

00:13:58.638 --> 00:14:00.806
A hot princess with
whom to get grizzly.

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.934
Hello.
Hello, baby!

00:14:04.894 --> 00:14:07.062
Huh? Hey,
what's going on here?

00:14:07.146 --> 00:14:10.023
And why are you kissing my
dashing cousin instead of me?

00:14:10.108 --> 00:14:12.234
Nikolai,
you imperial fool.

00:14:12.318 --> 00:14:14.820
We've been having
an affair for 700 years.

00:14:15.154 --> 00:14:18.156
At long last, I shall kill you, blame the burglar

00:14:18.241 --> 00:14:20.075
and inherit the throne.

00:14:27.625 --> 00:14:29.251
Farewell, Nikolai.

00:14:29.335 --> 00:14:30.919
Wait! I'm not Nikolai!

00:14:31.004 --> 00:14:33.839
I'm Bender, the fabulous body-switching burglar.

00:14:36.759 --> 00:14:39.845
So you are. However, you do have Nikolai's body,

00:14:39.929 --> 00:14:41.388
and that's the part
we want to kill.

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:56.903
Great food, huh?

00:14:58.364 --> 00:14:59.489
Ew!

00:14:59.616 --> 00:15:01.116
I'm sorry, Leela.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.910
I hope that didn't make you
ashamed to be seen with me.

00:15:04.162 --> 00:15:06.872
No, it only makes
you more attractive.

00:15:08.041 --> 00:15:09.625
Ew!

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:14.379
Oh! Did my bodily
infirmity embarrass you?

00:15:14.464 --> 00:15:15.464
Not at all.

00:15:15.548 --> 00:15:18.717
It's just another thing that
makes you a very special lady.

00:15:18.843 --> 00:15:20.052
You mean, like my penis?

00:15:22.347 --> 00:15:25.390
Admit it!
You're disgusted by me!

00:15:25.475 --> 00:15:27.934
No,
you're disgusted by me!

00:15:28.019 --> 00:15:30.187
I'm as attracted to
you as I've ever been!

00:15:30.271 --> 00:15:31.355
Prove it!

00:15:39.405 --> 00:15:43.408
Well, Bender, here's our apartment
that we live in every day.

00:15:44.994 --> 00:15:47.913
A floor?
We live like kings!

00:15:48.247 --> 00:15:49.456
Kings? Silence!

00:15:49.791 --> 00:15:51.458
Like you, I'm a common lout.

00:15:51.668 --> 00:15:53.335
Now fetch me some
working-class cognac

00:15:53.419 --> 00:15:55.879
from our brandy storeroom
that you know how to find.

00:15:55.963 --> 00:15:56.963
Uh...

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:05.681
Relax, Bender.

00:16:05.765 --> 00:16:08.266
I'll dry up that leak
with this heating box.

00:16:12.105 --> 00:16:14.856
Ah, cigars.
Light me up, old friend.

00:16:27.495 --> 00:16:29.162
There you are,
Emperor Nikolai.

00:16:29.288 --> 00:16:30.997
It's time for your
speech to the U. N.

00:16:31.457 --> 00:16:32.541
What now?

00:16:38.339 --> 00:16:39.339
Miss Wong?

00:16:39.424 --> 00:16:41.758
No, Scruffy,
I am Washbucket.

00:16:41.843 --> 00:16:45.262
I love you. Washbucket has always loved you.

00:16:48.391 --> 00:16:49.641
This is wrong, Washbucket.

00:16:50.059 --> 00:16:52.310
Oh, it would be
sweet for a while,

00:16:52.395 --> 00:16:55.105
but in the back of our minds,
we'd know that I'm a man

00:16:55.189 --> 00:16:56.648
and you're
janitorial equipment.

00:16:56.941 --> 00:17:00.277
In another city,
we could be anyone we want!

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:02.487
Go. Go now,

00:17:02.655 --> 00:17:04.114
before I beg you to stay.

00:17:13.332 --> 00:17:14.332
Yep.

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:21.339
Please welcome an insane
dictator, and one heck of a bowler,

00:17:21.424 --> 00:17:23.925
Emperor Nikolai!

00:17:26.387 --> 00:17:28.180
Thanks, Nixon.
How we doing?

00:17:28.264 --> 00:17:30.015
I love you,
Your Majesty!

00:17:30.099 --> 00:17:32.184
Shut up, Madame Ambassador!
I know it!

00:17:32.477 --> 00:17:33.560
Anyhow,

00:17:35.521 --> 00:17:38.440
I'd now like to digress
from my prepared remarks

00:17:38.524 --> 00:17:39.775
to say I'm done!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:45.113
Ladies and gentlemen,
this robot is an impostor!

00:17:50.077 --> 00:17:51.912
I shall enjoy this.

00:17:52.205 --> 00:17:53.622
Not me!

00:17:55.208 --> 00:17:57.667
That devil, Basil,
will kill our emperor.

00:17:57.752 --> 00:18:00.045
You're Robo-Hungarian?

00:18:00.129 --> 00:18:03.465
Yes. Our nation's
chief export is carnies.

00:18:03.549 --> 00:18:06.843
If only there were some way I
could get to the U. N. to help.

00:18:06.928 --> 00:18:09.679
There is.
Get in, Nonchalanto.

00:18:09.764 --> 00:18:11.807
Bertha, no!
It would kill you!

00:18:11.891 --> 00:18:14.684
I have not so much
time left anyhow.

00:18:14.769 --> 00:18:18.814
But you could get a new body!
You could have a rich, full life!

00:18:18.898 --> 00:18:22.317
I am trying to have
a rich, full life!

00:18:28.199 --> 00:18:30.158
Long live Robo-Hungary!

00:18:40.378 --> 00:18:42.170
Me!
Thank God you've come!

00:18:44.632 --> 00:18:46.967
This is for Big Bertha!

00:18:48.678 --> 00:18:51.429
That is not what I meant
to give you for Big Bertha.

00:18:53.683 --> 00:18:55.809
That was nice.

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:57.227
Oh, yeah.

00:19:04.402 --> 00:19:05.735
Ow! Ow!

00:19:15.955 --> 00:19:18.957
Whoever you are, you're the
bravest robot I've ever seen.

00:19:20.084 --> 00:19:21.668
I like killing brave things.

00:19:21.961 --> 00:19:25.171
Good! Because I've got
20 of them per cubic meter.

00:19:29.969 --> 00:19:32.512
When I grow up,
I want to be a diplomat!

00:19:36.809 --> 00:19:39.769
Well, if there's one thing
I've learned, it's a lesson.

00:19:39.854 --> 00:19:41.271
I believe this
belongs to you.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.859
I shall sell it to
help the common folk,

00:19:45.943 --> 00:19:47.903
now that I understand
their misery.

00:19:47.987 --> 00:19:49.154
Yeah, good luck with that.

00:19:49.405 --> 00:19:52.574
I must say, Hermes, you've
got a smoking-hot body.

00:19:52.658 --> 00:19:54.534
I was inspired by Amy.

00:19:55.244 --> 00:19:57.662
Wow! How'd you do it?
Well,

00:19:57.747 --> 00:20:00.749
there I was at Elzar's,
eating a nice pork sundae,

00:20:00.833 --> 00:20:02.834
and suddenly,
I just lost my appetite.

00:20:04.503 --> 00:20:05.503
Forever.

00:20:06.047 --> 00:20:07.672
Q to the E to the D!

00:20:08.007 --> 00:20:12.427
So it is possible for us all to
get back to our original bodies?

00:20:12.511 --> 00:20:14.262
Stone-cold munching, Prof.

00:20:14.347 --> 00:20:17.182
Sweet Clyde, characterize your inversion theorem.

00:20:17.725 --> 00:20:20.560
Basically, no matter how
permuted-up your minds are,

00:20:20.645 --> 00:20:23.730
they can be restored using,
at most, two extra players.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:28.944
And they say pure math has
no real-world applications!

00:20:37.578 --> 00:20:39.245
Everybody back
in their zones?

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.705
Yes sir!
Yes!

00:20:40.998 --> 00:20:44.542
Ah! My body may be old,
but it is mine.

00:20:44.877 --> 00:20:46.294
Brilliant work, Clyde!

00:20:46.379 --> 00:20:50.048
You'll win the NBA's highest
academic honor for this.

00:20:50.132 --> 00:20:51.967
Also,
I'm making you a duke.

00:20:52.385 --> 00:20:54.386
So long, filthy commoners!

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:55.595
Ў Adiуs!

00:20:56.973 --> 00:20:59.641
And I'm left with the real jewels safely inside...

00:20:59.976 --> 00:21:02.185
His compartment?

00:21:03.312 --> 00:21:05.730
All right.
I'll need accomplices.